description: Worktree, commit/push, and draft-PR discipline
alwaysApply: true
---

# Worktree and PR

- Never implement on `main` / `master`. Use an issue branch or worktree under `.trees/`.
- Commit and push meaningful progress; do not leave large uncommitted diffs.
- Open PRs as **draft**. `/build` does not mark ready; `/merge-pr` does after review.
- Never use `gh pr merge --admin` or force-push to shared default branches.
